            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "### Install with Linux package managers"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "Claude Code publishes signed apt, dnf, and apk repositories. Replace `stable` with `latest` for the rolling channel. Package manager installations do not auto-update through Claude Code; updates arrive through your normal system upgrade workflow."
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "All repositories are signed with the [Claude Code release signing key](#binary-integrity-and-code-signing). Before trusting the key, verify it as described in each tab."
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "For Debian and Ubuntu. To use the rolling channel, change both `stable` occurrences in the `deb` line: the URL path and the suite name."
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "```bash theme={null}"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "sudo install -d -m 0755 /etc/apt/keyrings"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "sudo curl -fsSL https://downloads.claude.ai/keys/claude-code.asc \\"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "  -o /etc/apt/keyrings/claude-code.asc"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "echo \"deb [signed-by=/etc/apt/keyrings/claude-code.asc] https://downloads.claude.ai/claude-code/apt/stable stable main\" \\"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "  | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/claude-code.list"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "sudo apt update"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "sudo apt install claude-code"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "```"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "Verify the GPG key fingerprint before trusting it: `gpg --show-keys /etc/apt/keyrings/claude-code.asc` should report `31DD DE24 DDFA B679 F42D 7BD2 BAA9 29FF 1A7E CACE`."
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "To upgrade later, run `sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade claude-code`."
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "For Fedora and RHEL:"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "```bash theme={null}"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "sudo tee /etc/yum.repos.d/claude-code.repo <<'EOF'"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "[claude-code]"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "name=Claude Code"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "baseurl=https://downloads.claude.ai/claude-code/rpm/stable"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "enabled=1"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "gpgcheck=1"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "gpgkey=https://downloads.claude.ai/keys/claude-code.asc"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "EOF"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "sudo dnf install claude-code"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "```"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "dnf downloads the key on first install and prompts you to confirm the fingerprint. Verify it matches `31DD DE24 DDFA B679 F42D 7BD2 BAA9 29FF 1A7E CACE` before accepting."
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "To upgrade later, run `sudo dnf upgrade claude-code`."
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "For Alpine Linux:"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "```sh theme={null}"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "wget -O /etc/apk/keys/claude-code.rsa.pub \\"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "  https://downloads.claude.ai/keys/claude-code.rsa.pub"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "echo \"https://downloads.claude.ai/claude-code/apk/stable\" >> /etc/apk/repositories"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "apk add claude-code"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "```"
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "Verify the downloaded key with `sha256sum /etc/apk/keys/claude-code.rsa.pub`, which should report `395759c1f7449ef4cdef305a42e820f3c766d6090d142634ebdb049f113168b6`."
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "added",
              "content": "To upgrade later, run `apk update && apk upgrade claude-code`."
            },
